{"answer":null,"concept_id":"cudagraph-forbidden-alloc-in-capture","content_sha256":"sha256:705a9ea541730be4a26cd80f6704e01358c0a8317afcc578585be7abf912b9a0","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789366773.753011,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有捕获限制概述、token 数设备指针。补禁止项清单。","id":"q-operator-graph-capture-alloc-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"捕获失败或把不该进图的操作冻进去。捕获窗口只应有 GPU 核与已注册的 memcpy。内存必须预分配（图内存池），同步应改成 event。这是捕获契约，不是性能开关"},{"id":"b","text":"捕获期间 malloc 会被记录为可回放的图节点，完全合法"},{"id":"c","text":"同步会让图更快，因为减少并发"},{"id":"d","text":"CPU 回调是 Graph 的一等节点，推荐使用"}],"prompt":"CUDA Graph 捕获期间做 cudaMalloc / 同步 / CPU 回调，会怎样？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"implementation","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM documentation","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"runtime","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
